ory":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows June to July came in under 90% of normal in 43 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. In 2025 the middle ran 154% of normal in June to July, then fell to 32% in November to December 2025. So far in 2026, June to July sits at 192% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
